 class=\"desc\">在首页输入框里写下要做的事，例如“审查这份股权转让协议，我方为受让方”，助手会选用合适的方法。</div><div class=\"card-actions\"><button class=\"btn-link\">开始 →</button></div></div><div class=\"section-title\">按业务场景</div><section aria-label=\"诉讼仲裁\"><div class=\"methods-line\">诉讼仲裁</div><div class=\"cards\"><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：整理案卷\"><span class=\"title\">整理案卷</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">证据目录 · 事实时间轴 · 争点证据矩阵 · 补证清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：起诉材料、证据、往来函件</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：整理案卷（精读版）\"><span class=\"title\">整理案卷（精读版）</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">案卷总目录 · 事实时间线 · 缺口清单 · 带引文的事实</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：起诉材料、证据、往来函件</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：争点与证据分析\"><span class=\"title\">争点与证据分析</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">争点—证据矩阵 · 补证清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：经你确认的事实</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：案情分析与诉讼策略\"><span class=\"title\">案情分析与诉讼策略</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">案情分析备忘录</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：案卷材料或“整理案卷”的成果</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：金额测算\"><span class=\"title\">金额测算</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">计算明细</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：合同与付款记录</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：起草起诉状\"><span class=\"title\">起草起诉状</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">民事起诉状 · 提交前核对清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：已整理的事实与金额</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：起草答辩状\"><span class=\"title\">起草答辩状</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">民事答辩状 · 答辩要点与证据对照表 · 提交前核对清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：对方起诉状 + 已确认的事实</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：起草上诉状\"><span class=\"title\">起草上诉状</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">民事上诉状 · 上诉理由与一审认定对照表 · 提交前核对清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：一审判决书或裁定书 + 已确认的事实</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：起草仲裁申请书\"><span class=\"title\">起草仲裁申请书</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">仲裁申请书 · 证据目录 · 提交前核对清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：含仲裁条款的合同 + 已确认的事实与金额</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：庭审提纲\"><span class=\"title\">庭审提纲</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">庭审提纲</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：诉辩文书、双方证据 + 已确认的事实</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：财产保全申请\"><span class=\"title\">财产保全申请</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">财产保全申请书 · 保全财产线索与担保核对表</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：诉讼或仲裁材料、你掌握的对方财产线索与担保安排</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：强制执行申请\"><span class=\"title\">强制执行申请</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">强制执行申请书 · 执行标的计算表 · 申请执行核对清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：生效判决、裁定、调解书或仲裁裁决 + 对方已履行的记录</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：质证意见\"><span class=\"title\">质证意见</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">质证意见 · 质证意见表</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：对方证据目录与证据材料</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：代理词\"><span class=\"title\">代理词</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">代理词 · 争点与依据对照表</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：庭审笔录或庭审要点 + 已确认的事实</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：新案受理与访谈\"><span class=\"title\">新案受理与访谈</span><span class=\"sc-gets\">访谈纪要 · 材料收集清单 · 紧急期限与冲突待核清单</span><span class=\"sc-gives\">需要：访谈记录或笔记、客户初步材料</span><span class=\"method-go\">开始 →</span></button><button class=\"card method-card\" aria-label=\"开始：管辖与时效核查\"><span class=\"title\">管辖与时效核查</span><span class=\"sc-gets\"